    "id": "physics-1788673833485-47-252",
    "questionText": "A radio station broadcasts at a frequency of 600KHz. If the speed of light in air is 3 × 10⁸ ms⁻¹. Calculate the wavelength of the radio wave (JAMB 2017)",
