    "correctAnswer": "D",
    "explanation": "Given information:\n\nPrimary voltage, Vₚ = 2.2 kV = 2200 V\nSecondary voltage, Vₛ = 110 V\nSecondary turns, Nₛ = 25 turns\nPrimary turns, Nₚ = ?\n\nSolution:\nStep 1: Apply transformer equation\nFor an ideal transformer:\nVₚ/Vₛ = Nₚ/Nₛ\nStep 2: Substitute the known values\n2200/110 = Nₚ/25\n20 = Nₚ/25\nStep 3: Solve for primary turns\nNₚ = 20 × 25\nNₚ = 500 turns"
