    "questionText": "The velocities of light in air and glass are 3.0 × 10⁸ ms⁻¹ and 2.0 × 10⁸ ms⁻¹ respectively. If the angle of refraction is 30°, the sine of the angle of incidence is? (JAMB 2021)",
