    "explanation": "Solution:\nGiven information:\n\nElectrochemical equivalent (Z) = 0.0012 g/C\nMass of silver (m) = 36.0 g\nTime (t) = 5 minutes = 5 × 60 = 300 seconds\nCurrent (I) = ?\n\nUsing Faraday's Law of Electrolysis:\nm = ZIt\nRearranging to find current:\nI = m/(Zt)\nSubstituting values:\nI = 36.0/(0.0012 × 300)\nI = 36.0/0.36\nI = 100 A"
