    "id": "physics-1788724898318-182-681",
    "questionText": "The resistance of a piece of wire of length 20 m and cross‑sectional area 8 × 10⁻⁶ m² is?\n[Resistivity of the wire = 4 × 10⁻⁷ Ω·m] (JAMB 2005)",
