    "explanation": "Boyle‘s law stats that the volume of a given mass of a gas, at a constant temperature is inversely proportional to us pressure.\n\nMathematically\n\nV ∝ l/p, v = k/p (where k is constant)\n\nK = VP\n\nLet k = k1\n\nThen, if k = k, V and P = V1P1\n\nV1P1 = V2P2"
