    "explanation": "Given information:\nCharge, q = 1.5 × 10⁻¹⁹ C\nElectric field intensity, E = 10⁵ V m⁻¹\n\nSolution:\n\nStep 1: Formula for force on a charge in an electric field\nF = q × E\n\nStep 2: Substitute values\nF = (1.5 × 10⁻¹⁹) × (10⁵)\n\nStep 3: Calculate\nF = 1.5 × 10⁻¹⁴ N"
