    "explanation": "Given information:\nForce F = 2 N\nAngle θ = 60°\nDisplacement s = 3 m\nFloor is smooth (no friction)\n\nSolution:\n\nStep 1: Work done formula\nWork done W = F × s × cosθ\n\nStep 2: Substitute values\nW = 2 N × 3 m × cos60°\n\nStep 3: Calculate\ncos60° = 0.5\nW = 2 × 3 × 0.5 = 3 J"
