    "explanation": "Given information:\n\nMass (m) = 50 kg\nHeight (h) = 5 m\nTime (t) = 5 seconds\nAcceleration due to gravity (g) = 10 m/s²\nPower (P) = ?\n\nStep 1: Calculate work done against gravity\nWork = Force × Distance\nWork = Weight × Height\nWork = mgh\nWork = 50 × 10 × 5\nWork = 2500 J\nStep 2: Calculate power\nPower = Work/Time\nP = 2500/5\nP = 500 W"
