    "explanation": "Given information:\nWavelength, λ = 15 cm = 0.15 m\nWave velocity, v = 300 m s⁻¹\n\nSolution:\n\nStep 1: Wave equation\nThe relationship between velocity, frequency, and wavelength is:\nv = f × λ\n\nStep 2: Rearrange for frequency\nf = v / λ\n\nStep 3: Substitute the values\nf = 300 / 0.15 = 2000 Hz\n\nStep 4: Express in scientific notation\n2000 Hz = 2.0 × 10³ Hz"
