    "questionText": "Caesium has a work function of 3 x 10⁻¹⁹ J. The maximum energy of liberated electrons when it is illuminated by light of frequency 6.7 x 10¹⁴ Hz is? [h = 6.6 x 10⁻³⁴ Js] (JAMB 2008)",
