    "explanation": "Given information:\n\nInitial angular velocity (ω₀) = 0 rad/s (starts from rest)\nFinal angular velocity (ω) = 4π rad/s\nTime (t) = 5 s\nAngular acceleration (α) = ?\n\nUsing angular motion equation:\nω = ω₀ + αt\nSince ω₀ = 0:\nω = αt\nRearranging to find α:\nα = ω/t\nSubstituting values:\nα = 4π/5\nα = 0.8π rad/s²"
