    "explanation": "Given information:\n\nDecay constant (λ) = 10⁻⁵ s⁻¹\nHalf-life (T₁/₂) = ?\n\nFormula relating half-life and decay constant:\nT₁/₂ = ln(2)/λ\nT₁/₂ = 0.693/λ\nSubstituting values:\nT₁/₂ = 0.693/(10⁻⁵)\nT₁/₂ = 0.693 × 10⁵\nT₁/₂ = 6.93 × 10⁴ s"
