    "explanation": "Given information:\n\nCost per kWh = N4\nVoltage (V) = 250 V\nCurrent (I) = 2 A\nTime (t) = 6 hours\nTotal cost = ?\n\nStep 1: Calculate power of the appliance\nP = VI\nP = 250 × 2\nP = 500 W = 0.5 kW\nStep 2: Calculate energy consumed\nEnergy = Power × Time\nE = 0.5 kW × 6 hours\nE = 3 kWh\nStep 3: Calculate total cost\nCost = Energy × Rate per kWh\nCost = 3 × N4\nCost = N12"
