    "explanation": "Given information:\nLoad, L = 800 N\nEffort, E = 250 N\nRadius of wheel, R = 800 mm = 0.8 m\nRadius of axle, r = 200 mm = 0.2 m\n\nSolution:\n\nStep 1: Calculate velocity ratio\nFor a wheel and axle, velocity ratio VR = R / r = 0.8 / 0.2 = 4\n\nStep 2: Calculate mechanical advantage\nMechanical advantage MA = L / E = 800 / 250 = 3.2\n\nStep 3: Calculate efficiency\nEfficiency η = MA / VR × 100% = 3.2 / 4 × 100% = 0.8 × 100% = 80%"
