    "explanation": "Given information:\n\nInductive reactance (Xₗ) = 1Ω\nFrequency (f) = 50/π Hz\nInductance (L) = ?\n\nFormula for Inductive Reactance:\nXₗ = 2πfL\nRearranging to find L:\nL = Xₗ/(2πf)\nSubstituting values:\nL = 1/(2π × 50/π)\nL = 1/(2 × 50)\nL = 1/100\nL = 0.01 H\nAnswer: B. 0.01H"
